                    <div class="section-kicker">
                        A SCHOOL WITH PURPOSE
                    </div>

                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        Education with
                        <span>Purpose.</span>
                    </h2>

                    <p class="section-copy">
                        St. Martin's High School, Balanagar,
                        Hyderabad, is committed to creating an
                        environment where every student is encouraged
                        to learn, question, discover and grow.
                    </p>

                    <p class="section-copy">
                        We believe education extends beyond academic
                        achievement. It is about developing character,
                        confidence, discipline, creativity and a genuine
                        sense of responsibility towards society.
                    </p>

                    <p class="section-copy">
                        Through a balanced approach to academics,
                        co-curricular experiences, technology,
                        sports and values-based learning, our school
                        strives to prepare students for a rapidly
                        changing world while keeping them firmly
                        grounded in timeless principles.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="intro-image">

                    <img src="/images/about-school.jpg"
                         alt="St. Martin's High School">

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>



